{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-12T21:25:15.228Z","author":"claude-orchestrator","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7d840ea47898a11b780b0864","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.269","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"ops-k9iv"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm CLI 2026.9.11 drops every pm-ops command, because its new core ops group collides at group level"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Measured 2026-09-12 while certifying pm CLI 2026.9.12. From 2026.9.11, pm-cli registers a core ops command group (stats, health, validate, gc, telemetry, eval, test-all), and extension collision is decided per group, not per leaf. All ten pm-ops commands (ops audit, docstrings, merge-receipts, metrics, outdated, policy, report, scan, status, verify-release) are dropped with extension_command_collision and core command preserved, although none of those leaves exists in core. Reproduced by installing this package into a fresh project: pm ops metrics prints usage on 2026.9.10 and fails with Unknown command metrics on 2026.9.11 and 2026.9.12. The package test 'installed pm CLI routes --repos values to every fleet command' fails on 2026.9.12 for exactly this reason. Library consumers that import pm-ops/attestation are unaffected, so the fleet's release gates keep working; the pm command surface is what breaks. Filed upstream as unbraind/pm-cli#1249."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-12T21:25:15.228Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-12T21:25:15.228Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-orchestrator"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Either pm-cli ships leaf-level collision detection, so pm ops metrics works with pm-ops installed on a CLI that has the core ops group, and this repository then certifies that CLI with its routing test passing unchanged; or pm-ops moves its commands to a namespace core does not own, with a documented migration path and the routing test updated to the new paths"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/blocked_reason","value":"Waiting on unbraind/pm-cli#1249: leaf-level extension collision under core command groups"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/docs","value":[{"path":"https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1249","scope":"project","note":"upstream issue for the group-level collision"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"c29cd838fe99da243471dcfb2ab67539bfae46b8d9678b218b9ff990e9672989","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"85452bdac32186b564c160a55626dca19e2322608a393d70eda6d67b48bdc2eb"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-12T21:25:15.797Z","author":"claude-orchestrator","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7d840ea47898a11b780b0864","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.269","source":"probe"}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-12T21:25:15.797Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"blocked"}],"before_hash":"c29cd838fe99da243471dcfb2ab67539bfae46b8d9678b218b9ff990e9672989","after_hash":"85d2ca4ed2b58a4ddf8e708b5a11b8b1215644286034157444b9567da0baedd7","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"dcb9381ae945a21cb37e7c890dda895d0799e00584b1a9c790be0bc1b33e1db3"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-17T19:41:27.057Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f5bdf90021cd4d245547a53a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-17T19:41:27.057Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-17T19:41:27.038Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Reproduced 2026-09-17 with pm-ops pinned binary @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17:\n\n$ ./node_modules/.bin/pm ops --help\nCommands (pm-ops extension leaves, 10/10 registered):\n  audit, docstrings, merge-receipts, metrics, outdated, policy, report, scan, status, verify-release\nCommands (core ops, 7/7 registered):\n  stats, health, validate, gc, telemetry, eval, test-all\n\n$ ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --output-budget unbounded\nextensions check: status=ok, ok=true\n  discovered: pm-ops v2026.8.31, status=ok, enabled=true\n  activation: command_handler_count=10, parser_override_count=10, commands=10\n  contributions.commands: [ops audit, ops docstrings, ops merge-receipts, ops metrics, ops outdated, ops policy, ops report, ops scan, ops status, ops verify-release]\ntriage: status=ok, load_failure_count=0, activation_failure_count=0, migration_failed_count=0\nmigration_status: failed_count=0\nhost_version: 2026.9.17\n\nAll ten pm-ops leaves register under `pm ops` alongside core's seven. Extension health ok, activation_failure_count: 0."}]}],"before_hash":"85d2ca4ed2b58a4ddf8e708b5a11b8b1215644286034157444b9567da0baedd7","after_hash":"6fde8ac06f13edb6340b6a0519f53a8c8c6ae76686efceb55f68eb06da6bb8cd","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"9496d2c1d49b0a1e1e91f0de26c0bb0b4b780142345bfdce27a7d1fb6a3f723f"}
